; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">1. 能力结论</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">2026 年 7 月中旬的独立评测里，Kimi K3 已进入全球<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">综合近前沿</strong>梯队：</p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">57 分</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 综合约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">第 3</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 落后 Claude Fable 5、GPT-5.6 Sol</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">高于</strong> Claude Opus 4.8 等上一档旗舰</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• LMArena Frontend Code：多份报道称其<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">登顶</strong></li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">2. 编程结论</h3></li></li></li><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Coding Agent Index 约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">57 分</strong>，联合约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">第 5</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 任务均价约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">$3.18</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 显著低于 Fable 5 max / Sol max 等「最强推理档」</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 对已测开源配置（如 GLM-5.2、DeepSeek V4 Pro）明显领先</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">3. 长程工作</h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• AA-Briefcase 等：约 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">第 2～3 名</strong>量级</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 与「只强写前端」的印象不符</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">4. 主要争议（不在「是否水榜」）</h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 仍非全面第一</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• token / 任务成本叙事分裂</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 推理服务延迟与暂停新订</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 自托管硬件门槛</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 生产多步 agent 成功率与安全评测尚未闭合</li></ul><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-heig