: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">Ethan Mollick：</strong><br>开源追闭源是连续过程；<br>K3 写作类未必赢 Fable；<br>权重放出后的安全基准值得盯</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">投资 / 市场叙事</strong>（媒体转述如 Gavin Baker 等）：<br>对闭源 API 有压力；<br>对云与推理基础设施可能偏利好<br>→ <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">属投资叙事，非模型基准</strong></li></ul><hr class="hr" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;"><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">7.3 Builder 视角</h3><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 快速接入 coding agent / 路由层</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 强调「用 harness 吃模型红利」</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 冷静派：<ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 能力近 Opus 4.8 档、价格有优势</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 但有 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">美企合规</strong>、生态迁移成本</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 仍存在更便宜的其他中文模型</li></ul></ul><hr class="hr" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;"><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">八、完整结论（对外可引用版）</h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">8.1 能力结论</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;">在 2026-07 中旬<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">独立评测快照</strong>下：</p><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">1. Kimi K3 属于<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">全球近前沿</strong>；综合约前三，<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">尚未全面登顶</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">2. <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">编程与前端</strong>是最扎实优势区<br>（Coding Agent 近旗舰；Frontend 多源称第一）</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">3. <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">长程知识工作</strong>同样进入顶尖区</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">4. 相对 K2 系列，能力跃迁与斜率（Vals 等）获第三方支持</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">8.2 成本与工程结论</h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">1. 相对 Fable / Sol 等 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">max 推理档</strong>，任务成本常更有优势</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">2. 相对 <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">上代 Kimi</strong> 与部分同档便宜模型，并不「全面更便宜」</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">3. <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">Token 饥渴</strong>与 AA / Vals 效率数据并存<br>→ 产品核算必须以<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">自有任务分布</strong>重测</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">4. <strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">服务容量与延迟</strong>是当前最硬负面工程事实<br>（官方暂停新订 + 社区延迟观测）</li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">8.3 战略结论（超出单模型）</h3><ol class="ol" style="padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">1. 问题从「中国能不能做出近前沿」<br>转为「近前沿可下载 / 低价调用时，价值落在模型还是 harness / 云 / 合规」</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">2. Open-weight 若兑现：<br>强化「编码 / agent 基建」与「监管 FUD」两条并行叙事</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">3. 权重与安全报告完整前：<br>「生产全量替换 Fable / Sol」<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">证据不足</strong></li></ol><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">8.4 给不同读者的操作建议</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">个人开发者 / 小团队</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 适合作为 coding agent / 前端生成的<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">主力候选</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 务必压测：延迟、$/成功任务</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">企业技术决策</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 可做<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">影子流量 / 灰度</strong></li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 采购单列：合规与数据路径</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">内容与研究</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 可引用四条硬事实：<ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• AA #3</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Coding #5</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• Frontend #1</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 暂停新订</li></ul><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 避免只转发情绪帖</li></ul><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">投资读者</strong></p><ul class="ul" style="list-style: circle; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0; color: #3f3f3f;"><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 本报告<strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">不</strong>给买卖结论</li><li class="listitem" style="display: block; margin: 0.2em 8px; color: #3f3f3f;">• 模型能力 ≠ 公司估值</li></ul><hr class="hr" style="border-style: solid; border-width: 2px 0 0; border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); -webkit-transform-origin: 0 0; -webkit-transform: scale(1, 0.5); transform-origin: 0 0; transform: scale(1, 0.5); height: 0.4em; margin: 1.5em 0;"><h2 class="h2" data-heading="true" style="display: table; padding: 0 0.2em; margin: 4em auto 2em; color: #fff; background: #0F4C81; font-size: calc(16px * 1.2); font-weight: bold; text-align: center;">九、来源总表（完整）</h2><h3 class="h3" data-heading="true" style="padding-left: 8px; border-left: 3px solid #0F4C81; margin: 2em 8px 0.75em 0; color: #3f3f3f; font-size: calc(16px * 1.1); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2;">9.1 第三方基准与数据</h3><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">S1 · Artificial Analysis 模型页</strong><br>https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/kimi-k3\<br>→ 综合指数、成本、分项入口</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">S2 · Intelligence Index 解读</strong><br>https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2077832874183860404\<br>→ Index 57、成本、$0.94/task、相对 K2.6</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><strong style="color: #0F4C81; font-weight: bold; font-size: inherit;">S3 · 前沿格局</strong><br>https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2078165665278730490\<br>→ #3、六实验室 &gt;50 分、Briefcase / GDPval 口径</p><p class="p" style="margin: 1.5em 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #3f3f3f;"><stron